<!--
  TGL is a single-page site: every section (#about, #categories, #register …)
  is an in-page anchor, not a separate URL. Search engines discard the
  fragment, so listing those anchors would just be the same URL repeated and
  would be treated as an error rather than as extra pages. One canonical URL
  is therefore the correct and complete sitemap here.

  lastmod is the date the page content last actually changed. Keep it honest —
  bumping it without a real content change is a quality signal problem, not a
  ranking trick.
-->
